fallback ran without tools: partition findings could not be verified…\". An oversized area can fall back to partitioning without tools. The area session then runs unverified, but the final plan reports no limitation.\n\nMerge the area limitations and advisories into `original` before returning.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n   const sessions = plans.flatMap((plan) => plan.sessions);\n+  for (const plan of plans) {\n+    for (const limitation of plan.limitations)\n+      if (!original.limitations.includes(limitation)) original.limitations.push(limitation);\n+    for (const advisory of plan.advisories)\n+      if (!original.advisories.includes(advisory)) original.advisories.push(advisory);\n+  }\n```\n</details>","id":"d6fbb95e57088d08e1dcb4359de4d133a883c6eff3c785e0e5e09d86e5d56a6b","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/areaReviewPlan.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Area plan `limitations` and `advisories` are discarded. The returned plan can overstate verification."}],"head":"9ca0120bf1b1ee407476ba21d6dc64d1568976ec","head_tree":"a619b07177492e5c80d4ce45880731ec409f8b2c","input_scope":[{"blob":"41460161464639fd8f4731a5c569dc15b420b5bc","intervals":[[1,59]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/areaReviewPlan.ts"},{"blob":"86c8dcc05d2dbf241090059bdf41732d849c7568","intervals":[[1,11]],"path":"src/ops/review/internal/branchKey.ts"}],"job_id":"83fa5b9feb5f75cf306595be5efe4795c31ad535be12dfdd76f2a561a310037f:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"41460161464639fd8f4731a5c569dc15b420b5bc","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/areaReviewPlan.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"86c8dcc05d2dbf241090059bdf41732d849c7568","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/internal/branchKey.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}]